    "description": "Use only completed prior non-penalty Understat shot events. For each team and match, compute count-weighted HHI over the provider lastAction categories for shots created and shots conceded. Over the latest 8 completed prior league matches, average attack and concede HHI. Match scalar is abs(home_attack_hhi * away_concede_hhi - away_attack_hhi * home_concede_hhi). This is categorical chance-creation-route concentration, not xG-per-shot concentration, shot-location concentration, shot-time concentration, set-piece share, score-state response, lineup continuity, or workload.",
